<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1722413135"/></metadata></head><body dur="5:54.933"><div begin="13.220" end="39.863" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="13.220" end="18.650" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.220" end="14.114">我们</span><span begin="14.396" end="16.520">正需要一场</span><span begin="16.520" end="18.650">瓢泼的雨</span></p><p begin="18.980" end="25.500" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.980" end="19.304">来</span><span begin="19.304" end="20.837">冲洗</span><span begin="21.059" end="22.573">这旧日的</span><span begin="22.573" end="22.927">不</span><span begin="22.927" end="25.500">喜</span></p><p begin="26.360" end="31.811" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.360" end="26.747">鸟</span><span begin="26.747" end="27.594">儿</span><span begin="27.594" end="29.557">都飞到房檐</span><span begin="29.557" end="31.248">下的新</span><span begin="31.248" end="31.811">巢</span></p><p begin="32.070" end="39.863" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.070" end="32.433">淋</span><span begin="32.433" end="33.771">湿的</span><span begin="34.087" end="34.623">身影</span><span begin="34.623" end="35.965">要归</span><span begin="35.965" end="36.415">去哪</span><span begin="36.415" end="39.863">里</span></p></div><div begin="42.800" end="1:08.190" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="42.800" end="48.710" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.800" end="43.112">昨</span><span begin="43.112" end="44.002">日</span><span begin="44.002" end="45.089">是庆幸</span><span begin="45.089" end="45.947">着 为何</span><span begin="45.947" end="46.956">今日</span><span begin="46.956" end="47.616">要感</span><span begin="47.616" end="48.710">伤</span></p><p begin="49.290" end="53.500" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.290" end="50.210">让烦恼</span><span begin="50.210" end="50.661">都</span><span begin="50.661" end="51.156">随雨</span><span begin="51.156" end="52.631">流进下水</span><span begin="52.631" end="53.500">道</span></p><p begin="56.010" end="1:01.800" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.010" end="56.267">只</span><span begin="56.267" end="57.264">是</span><span begin="57.264" end="58.454">我不能</span><span begin="58.454" end="1:00.121">抑制自己</span><span begin="1:00.121" end="1:00.732">的感</span><span begin="1:00.732" end="1:01.800">伤</span></p><p begin="1:02.170" end="1:08.190" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.170" end="1:03.334">那就让我</span><span begin="1:03.334" end="1:05.107">随波逐流</span><span begin="1:05.107" end="1:05.340">去</span><span begin="1:05.340" end="1:06.310">放</span><span begin="1:06.310" end="1:08.190">荡</span></p></div><div begin="1:09.200" end="1:28.210" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:09.200" end="1:14.980" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.200" end="1:11.822">天空很远</span> <span begin="1:12.354" end="1:14.980">夕阳很近</span></p><p begin="1:15.288" end="1:21.600" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.288" end="1:16.578">顺着那条小路</span> <span begin="1:16.578" end="1:17.237">是你</span><span begin="1:17.237" end="1:18.246">回家</span><span begin="1:18.246" end="1:18.513">的</span><span begin="1:18.513" end="1:19.516">方</span><span begin="1:19.516" end="1:21.600">向</span></p><p begin="1:21.900" end="1:28.210" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.900" end="1:23.436">那个黄昏有最温</span><span begin="1:23.436" end="1:23.926">馨的</span><span begin="1:23.926" end="1:25.805">晚餐 和慈祥的</span><span begin="1:25.805" end="1:26.239">脸</span><span begin="1:26.239" end="1:28.210">庞</span></p></div><div begin="1:28.910" end="1:59.882" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:28.910" end="1:34.900" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.910" end="1:30.533">月亮入</span><span begin="1:30.533" end="1:31.662">睡</span> <span begin="1:32.013" end="1:33.743">在有星星下的</span><span begin="1:33.743" end="1:34.900">路口</span></p><p begin="1:35.081" end="1:41.330" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.081" end="1:36.283">那是迫不及待</span><span begin="1:36.283" end="1:37.018">寻找</span><span be